==Finnish==
{{wikipedia|lang=fi}}

===Etymology 1===
An archaic active present participle form of the verb {{m|fi|syödä}} ({{suffix|fi|syödä|alt1=syö-|pa|alt2=pä|id2=participial}}). {{lit|that which eats}}, so called because the disease was once believed to be caused by a worm that eats the body from inside. Compare the archaic synonyms {{m|fi|ruumiinmato|lit=worm of the body}} and {{m|fi|koi|lit=moth|id=moth}}.

